    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bishop",
        "text": "Mixed-breeds... You mixed-breeds!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bishop",
        "text": "Herald! What's the meaning of this?! Why are they still alive? What of theirs is worth sparing?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bishop",
        "text": "You must have realized they were nothing like you when first they slaughtered our bloodkin!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bishop",
        "text": "You are a holy being, and they are mere filth!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "*Spit*..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "Very flexible, eh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "We hacked away at your kind with cold weapons so as to not expose you to our technology. That way, you will never become something we can't deal with."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "But I guess I overestimated. You don't seem very sensitive at all... Can't even adjust to this much?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "Looks like you just can't adapt to blades forged by \u00c6gir technology. Am I right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_186"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_184"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bishop",
        "text": "Herald, she is insulting you!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "Bishop, oh, bishop... Can't you tell? Heh. Yes, I am confident I can kill you, and I could have done so right from the start."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_186"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.8,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 70,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "(Low roar)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "Ugh... (Cough)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "Brother, why won't you accept them?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "They are my sisters, and so they are your sisters too."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "I can rouse you, rouse Ishar-mla, and, of course... Gla-dia too."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "Just because your brothers swam for the shallow seas, you no longer recognize them as your brothers. You haven't looked back even once..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "But our tribe cares."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_184"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bishop",
        "text": "No... This is nonsense..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "So you believe every single word in that good book you're holding? Let me remind you, Bishop, but you, too, are spreading heresy in full view of the Iberians."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "It doesn't matter to me one bit what this thing tells me, but you are from the Church of the Deep. Perhaps you should be taking notes?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_184"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bishop",
        "text": "Kill them... Kill them! Herald, do it! Their crimes are grave and unforgivable! They spout blasphemy against you and the sea!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_186"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "If that is your wish... then I shall do it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_184"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bishop",
        "text": "It doesn't matter to you at all, does it? It doesn't matter if I ask this of you. You said so yourself! You will kill them!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_186"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "Yes, It doesn't matter to me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_184"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bishop",
        "text": "Then kill the... wandering singer first. Kill the one in the red dress!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "Trash. If I tell you to kill the person behind you, the bishop who's dressed like a strand of kelp, will you do it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_186"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_184"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 70,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bishop",
        "text": "...!!!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_186"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "Because he is my kin, and so are you. He calls out to me, and so do you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "Ah, humans."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "\u00c6gir are vile and hideous, aren't they? Admit it, Bishop."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "We are all foolish \u00c6gir, and we like to apply what we think to lowlife beasts. You don't understand it at all."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_184"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 30,
            "ystrength": 30,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bishop",
        "text": "You mixed-blood!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "Well, if all you want is to protect us\u2014Why not refuse?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_186"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "Refuse?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "How do I... refuse?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "Enough. Looks like you are indeed a lowlife. That's about as deep as you can swim."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "But listen up, Trash. I won't ask you to kill the weakling behind you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "You are prey. Who would beg prey to do something?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "You want to hurt her? You will listen to his suggestion and kill Skadi, my hunter? You don't need that answer anymore, do you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_186"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "I have other ways, even with her dead. As long as there's a way, it doesn't matter to me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "But you told me... to refuse..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "Way too soon... *cough*..."
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 70,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "(Coughs up blood)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "*Spit*. Whatever. If you have your heart set on killing her\u2014You must first go through me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_186"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "Now, Gla-dia."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "Whether you get to live and whether your flesh will continue to function... This is for you to decide."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "And let us decide that by hunting each other."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_186"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seaborn",
        "text": "Each other... Each other. Yes. We will prey on each other. You will prey on me, and I will prey on you."
    },
